  "notes": [
    "__user__ is no longer a memory namespace: the runtime migrates memory/__user__.db into the canonical user_memory.db at boot and retires the file to __user__.db.migrated (supervisor/persistence.rs), and list_memory_namespaces only scans memory/*.db. The namespace walk therefore runs on apollia-guide, the seeded agent namespace that populates all four type tabs.",
    "The search assertion uses 'operator', the value of the sem-guide-mode entry: it is ASCII (no FTS accent folding to rely on) and belongs to apollia-guide, so it matches exactly one of the namespace's own entries. 'onboarding' matches an entry owned by another agent, which search_memory scopes out."
  ]
